                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Modification Proposed Concerning
                        the Distribution of the Contingents</hi></p>
                <p>The French Representatives propose to the American, British and Italian
                    Representatives that in modification of what was decreed on October 16, one
                    French battalion be located in Memel in place of the American battalion provided
                    for, this latter to proceed to Upper Silesia to replace the French battalion
                    retired.</p>
                <p>If this proposal is approved, the annexed table should be substituted for the
                    table annexed to the report.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
